From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 12:45:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] quickjs: Bump servo-quickjs for Intl over the system ICU

servo-quickjs fdb3eab builds its Intl subset over the system ICU on
Linux, with the same code as over the NDK's ICU on OpenHarmony, so the
desktop QuickJS build has Intl like the device. Building it now needs
ICU's development package, which `mach bootstrap` installs.

localeCompare now passes on QuickJS. The _mozilla/interfaces tests
still fail, now on AsyncDisposableStack.

Fork note: the self-hosted Linux runners bootstrap when their image is built, so their QuickJS builds need an image built from a revision with this patch.

Validation: `./mach build --release --js-engine quickjs` linked libicui18n.so.74, and `xvfb-run ./mach smoketest --release` passed. A full WPT run of the same tree built from a local clone (74848c3, identical to fdb3eab) had 59 tests with unexpected results; 3 more runs of the 19 not seen with the previous build matched the previous build and SpiderMonkey, except localeCompare, which now passes as with SpiderMonkey. `./mach test-tidy` passes.
AI-assisted: Yes (agent session; written by the agent, which also ran the build and WPT runs above)
Signed-off-by: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
---
 python/servo/platform/linux_packages/apt/apt_common.txt | 1 +
 python/servo/platform/linux_packages/dnf/dnf_base.txt   | 1 +
 python/servo/platform/linux_packages/xbps/xbps_base.txt | 1 +
 support/quickjs/cargo-config.toml                       | 2 +-
 tests/wpt/mozilla/meta/mozilla/localeCompare.html.ini   | 4 ----
 5 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 tests/wpt/mozilla/meta/mozilla/localeCompare.html.ini

diff --git a/python/servo/platform/linux_packages/apt/apt_common.txt b/python/servo/platform/linux_packages/apt/apt_common.txt
