--- a/tests/wpt/mozilla/meta/mozilla/localeCompare.html.ini
+++ /dev/null
@@ -1,4 +0,0 @@
-[localeCompare.html]
-  [localeCompare should return the same as other browsers, even though it's implementation-dependent]
-    expected:
-      if js_engine == "quickjs": FAIL
